{"4232750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Socket", "steam_appid": 4232750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Socket is a first-person psychological horror game about the victims of a Great Tragedy thirty years ago</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/9446dc01a1f70ac1bda743d994dd23d4.poster.avif?t=1772802803\" aria-label=\"Socket logo\" width=1170 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/9446dc01a1f70ac1bda743d994dd23d4.webm?t=1772802803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“30 years later: the Van der Wonder cocoa factory disaster”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city still remembers that terrible day when fire engulfed the Van der Wonder factory. Witnesses say the flames were visible for miles, and the sirens blared all night. But even 30 years later, the details of what happened remain a mystery. What was Van der Wonder's reaction? Who was punished? What lies behind the legacy of the world's largest cocoa empire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/4ef8980c14393d937ffb92824b35d00b.poster.avif?t=1772802803\" aria-label=\"Van der Wonder presents\" width=1170 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/4ef8980c14393d937ffb92824b35d00b.webm?t=1772802803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Worm your way into their confidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congrats on your first day at work! Here’s what you’ll be doing: going door-to-door, handing out flyers, and meeting the locals. Remember to be friendly and polite - it goes a long way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/3aa44bae049a53b68ced7c32f8ae21e7.poster.avif?t=1772802803\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/3aa44bae049a53b68ced7c32f8ae21e7.webm?t=1772802803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/3aa44bae049a53b68ced7c32f8ae21e7.mp4?t=1772802803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig through their dirty laundry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need to know what they eat, what they read, and what notes they leave in the margins. Trust me, Tim, there will definitely be notes in the margins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/d688bb0b459cecece2d5732e1c738a98.poster.avif?t=1772802803\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/d688bb0b459cecece2d5732e1c738a98.webm?t=1772802803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Burn out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tim, you probably just felt unwell. Maybe it was stuffy or something like that. Don’t overthink it — that idiot isn’t worth stressing over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/b0d1ad0dfe7b810a6df2a2c7c3fcf8d1.poster.avif?t=1772802803\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/b0d1ad0dfe7b810a6df2a2c7c3fcf8d1.webm?t=1772802803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don’t forget to take care of yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll have the last task. This time, the very last one. We can’t take any risks, Tim. We left something in the locked apartment on the second floor…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/46360b817df00270dd6beafac1c40d27.poster.avif?t=1772802803\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/46360b817df00270dd6beafac1c40d27.webm?t=1772802803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Socket is a first-person psychological horror game about the victims of a Great Tragedy thirty years ago</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/9446dc01a1f70ac1bda743d994dd23d4.poster.avif?t=1772802803\" aria-label=\"Socket logo\" width=1170 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/9446dc01a1f70ac1bda743d994dd23d4.webm?t=1772802803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“30 years later: the Van der Wonder cocoa factory disaster”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city still remembers that