 leave in the margins. Trust me, Tim, there will definitely be notes in the margins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/d688bb0b459cecece2d5732e1c738a98.poster.avif?t=1772802803\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/d688bb0b459cecece2d5732e1c738a98.webm?t=1772802803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Burn out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tim, you probably just felt unwell. Maybe it was stuffy or something like that. Don’t overthink it — that idiot isn’t worth stressing over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/b0d1ad0dfe7b810a6df2a2c7c3fcf8d1.poster.avif?t=1772802803\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/b0d1ad0dfe7b810a6df2a2c7c3fcf8d1.webm?t=1772802803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don’t forget to take care of yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll have the last task. This time, the very last one. We can’t take any risks, Tim. We left something in the locked apartment on the second floor…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/46360b817df00270dd6beafac1c40d27.poster.avif?t=1772802803\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/extras/46360b817df00270dd6beafac1c40d27.webm?t=1772802803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A first-person psychological horror game where you play as a social worker who obeys a wall socket. Follow its instructions, explore the city’s last inhabited apartment building, and pry secrets from its residents. All to fulfill the terms of the contract.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/d7969d2725fdef30f8f883f1cad0bd02bcf67131/header.jpg?t=1772802803", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/ee6a8568cfe4cc42cf4b767cea0af177a696d953/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772802803", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232750/ee6a8568cfe4cc42cf4b767cea0af177a696d953/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772802803", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 980<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_req